_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1210446032:1":{"text":"이제 좀 말이 통하네요.","source_cn":"这还差不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC443F9EFEB8CA1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1210446033:1":{"text":"신밧드, 같이 돌아갈 건가요?","source_cn":"辛巴达要一起回去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAADC0196B6664DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1210446034:1":{"text":"당연하지. 물귀신을 다시 만날까 봐 무섭단 말이야. 이런 황량한 곳보다는 너희랑 같이 있는 게 더 안전해.","source_cn":"当然，我害怕再遇到水鬼。荒郊野岭的，还是和你们一起更安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3230F7AA1EB3129A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1210446035:1":{"text":"참, 블러디 로즈의 두목과 부두목에게 내 소개를 하지 않았군.","source_cn":"对了，还没向血薇帮的老大和二当家自我介绍呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE17D086B5CDA40AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1210446036:1":{"text":"만나서 반가워. 난 신밧드라고 해. 부두에서 밥벌이를 하고 있지.","source_cn":"你们好，我是辛巴达，在码头上混饭吃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE44E93EA4E9C4F84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1210446037:1":{"text":"반가워, 루카에게 얘기 들었어.","source_cn":"你好，辛巴达。我听卢卡说过你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7935E0BC5B74AFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1210446038:1":{"text":"시끄럽고 불성실한 녀석이라고 평가했지.","source_cn":"我的评价：呱噪，不诚实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B06CBED775F4EA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:68:1210446038":{"text":"시끄럽고 불성실한 녀석이라고 평가했지.","source_cn":"我的评价：呱噪，不诚实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B06CBED775F4EA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1210446039:1":{"text":"교활한 신밧드 덕분에 러스트 항을 떠나려다가 후긴을 만나고, 여러분까지 만나게 되었네요.","source_cn":"多亏了狡猾的辛巴达，我们本来要离开锈锚港的，又被他带来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD29858A2D7076D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1210446040:1":{"text":"아하... 먹고 살기 힘들어서 길 안내를 하고 밥값을 좀 번 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"啊哈……生活不易，领个路，赚点吃饭钱而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BC0C2BC1A0CE69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1210446041:1":{"text":"그렇군...","source_cn":"是吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C05D3752325395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1210446042:1":{"text":"미리 말해두지만, 난 물귀신이 아니야! 다들 알다시피 우리 마을은 물귀신파에 자주 약탈을 당했어. 내가 물귀신에 합류했다면 그 녀석들이 같은 편인 나를 때리지는 않았겠지, 안 그래?","source_cn":"声明一下，我可不是水鬼！你也知道，我们村子经常被水鬼帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F72943D8FCC4F30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1210446043:1":{"text":"어쨌든... 우선 러스트 항으로 돌아가도록 하지. 물귀신파 습격으로 더 급하게 처리해야 할 일이 생겼으니 말이야.","source_cn":"总之……先回锈锚港吧，水鬼帮来袭，我们还有更紧急的事要处理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADA9D5DFA5865A45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:76:1210446044:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈의 귀한 손님이 된 우리는 그들과 함께 러스트 항으로 돌아갔다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1054CE0F48B83DDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:68:0:1":{"text":"찬성이야","source_cn":"赞同","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48AF06DEC6A3DA04","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"찬성이야","female":"찬성이야","variant_male_record_index":"66240","variant_female_record_index":"66241","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:68:1:2":{"text":"그래도 신밧드가 길 안내를 해줘서 살았어","source_cn":"但多亏了辛巴达引路","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF2596633CA6AF8F4","varia